<title>CHINA: China's Fujian gold output at 450 kg in Jan-April.</title>
<headline>China's Fujian gold output at 450 kg in Jan-April.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's southern province of Fujian produced 450 kilos of gold in the first four months of this year, the Financial News said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It did not give a January to April figure for last year but said the province produced 650 kg of gold in all of 1996.</p>
<p>The full-year 1996 tally was 347 percent of the output plan ordered by the central government, the newspaper said without giving further details.</p>
<p>--Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
